{"id":"a4daa2d7bdea73d3","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-function-tree.md","title":"部分可计算函数树","display":"df-function-tree — 部分可计算函数树","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-function-tree","aliases":["20-df-function-tree"],"display":"df-function-tree — 部分可计算函数树","chapter":"12","section":"12.1","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 12.1.2","source_pdf_pages":[227],"source_printed_pages":[197],"depends_on":["[[20-df-strings]]","[[20-df-partial-function]]","[[20-df-computable]]","[[20-df-numbering]]","[[20-df-stages]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-function-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-function-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-function-tree — 部分可计算函数树"},{"key":"chapter","html":"12"},{"key":"section","html":"12.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 12.1.2"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>227</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>197</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3f7915f8f8ad037c\" href=\"?note=3f7915f8f8ad037c\" title=\"20-df-partial-function\">20-df-partial-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\times2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\times2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 为候选图；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,s\\in\\omega\">\\(j,s\\in\\omega\\)</span>。部分可计算性使用原有二进制串 code 与普通程序编号，不另选树的编号。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3f7915f8f8ad037c\" href=\"?note=3f7915f8f8ad037c\" title=\"20-df-partial-function\">20-df-partial-function</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}function\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nT_j:=\\{(\\alpha,\\beta)\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\times2^{&lt;\\omega}:\n\\varphi_j(\\operatorname{code}(\\alpha))\\downarrow=\\operatorname{code}(\\beta)\\},\\\\\nT_{j,s}:=\\{(\\alpha,\\beta)\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\times2^{&lt;\\omega}:\n\\varphi_{j,s}(\\operatorname{code}(\\alpha))\\downarrow=\\operatorname{code}(\\beta)\\},\\\\\nT_j(\\alpha)\\downarrow=\\beta\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\varphi_j(\\operatorname{code}(\\alpha))\\downarrow=\\operatorname{code}(\\beta),\\\\\nT_{j,s}(\\alpha)\\downarrow=\\beta\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\varphi_{j,s}(\\operatorname{code}(\\alpha))\\downarrow=\\operatorname{code}(\\beta),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FTree}(T)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\bigl(T:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{&lt;\\omega}\\bigr)\\land\n(\\exists j\\in\\omega\\ [T=T_j])\\\\\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\Bigl[\n(T(\\alpha^\\frown0)\\downarrow\\lor T(\\alpha^\\frown1)\\downarrow)\\Rightarrow\n\\exists\\nu,\\rho,\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\\n\\bigl(T(\\alpha)\\downarrow=\\nu\\land\nT(\\alpha^\\frown0)\\downarrow=\\rho\\land T(\\alpha^\\frown1)\\downarrow=\\tau\\\\\n\\land\\nu\\prec\\rho\\land\\nu\\prec\\tau\\land\\rho\\perp\\tau\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}function\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nT_j:=\\{(\\alpha,\\beta)\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\times2^{&lt;\\omega}:\n\\varphi_j(\\operatorname{code}(\\alpha))\\downarrow=\\operatorname{code}(\\beta)\\},\\\\\nT_{j,s}:=\\{(\\alpha,\\beta)\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\times2^{&lt;\\omega}:\n\\varphi_{j,s}(\\operatorname{code}(\\alpha))\\downarrow=\\operatorname{code}(\\beta)\\},\\\\\nT_j(\\alpha)\\downarrow=\\beta\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\varphi_j(\\operatorname{code}(\\alpha))\\downarrow=\\operatorname{code}(\\beta),\\\\\nT_{j,s}(\\alpha)\\downarrow=\\beta\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\varphi_{j,s}(\\operatorname{code}(\\alpha))\\downarrow=\\operatorname{code}(\\beta),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FTree}(T)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\bigl(T:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{&lt;\\omega}\\bigr)\\land\n(\\exists j\\in\\omega\\ [T=T_j])\\\\\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\Bigl[\n(T(\\alpha^\\frown0)\\downarrow\\lor T(\\alpha^\\frown1)\\downarrow)\\Rightarrow\n\\exists\\nu,\\rho,\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\\n\\bigl(T(\\alpha)\\downarrow=\\nu\\land\nT(\\alpha^\\frown0)\\downarrow=\\rho\\land T(\\alpha^\\frown1)\\downarrow=\\tau\\\\\n\\land\\nu\\prec\\rho\\land\\nu\\prec\\tau\\land\\rho\\perp\\tau\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>FTree 原来在局部假设中要求的部分函数和部分可计算性现在写入谓词本身；在原适用域上条件没有改变。三个输出值先绑定再比较前缀，避免在父节点或兄弟节点尚未定义时取其值。仍允许空函数树，仍保留只要任一子节点定义就要求父节点及两个子节点均定义的原条件。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 12.1.2；印刷页 197；PDF 第 227 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"3f7915f8f8ad037c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-partial-function]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"3f7915f8f8ad037c","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-partial-function]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-partial-function]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-partial-function]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-partial-function]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}\\times2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta\\in2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"j,s\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}function\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nT_j:=\\{(\\alpha,\\beta)\\in2^{<\\omega}\\times2^{<\\omega}:\n\\varphi_j(\\operatorname{code}(\\alpha))\\downarrow=\\operatorname{code}(\\beta)\\},\\\\\nT_{j,s}:=\\{(\\alpha,\\beta)\\in2^{<\\omega}\\times2^{<\\omega}:\n\\varphi_{j,s}(\\operatorname{code}(\\alpha))\\downarrow=\\operatorname{code}(\\beta)\\},\\\\\nT_j(\\alpha)\\downarrow=\\beta\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\varphi_j(\\operatorname{code}(\\alpha))\\downarrow=\\operatorname{code}(\\beta),\\\\\nT_{j,s}(\\alpha)\\downarrow=\\beta\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\varphi_{j,s}(\\operatorname{code}(\\alpha))\\downarrow=\\operatorname{code}(\\beta),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FTree}(T)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\bigl(T:2^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{<\\omega}\\bigr)\\land\n(\\exists j\\in\\omega\\ [T=T_j])\\\\\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in2^{<\\omega}\\ \\Bigl[\n(T(\\alpha^\\frown0)\\downarrow\\lor T(\\alpha^\\frown1)\\downarrow)\\Rightarrow\n\\exists\\nu,\\rho,\\tau\\in2^{<\\omega}\\\n\\bigl(T(\\alpha)\\downarrow=\\nu\\land\nT(\\alpha^\\frown0)\\downarrow=\\rho\\land T(\\alpha^\\frown1)\\downarrow=\\tau\\\\\n\\land\\nu\\prec\\rho\\land\\nu\\prec\\tau\\land\\rho\\perp\\tau\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":2528,"backlinks":[{"id":"5c8fcd5a2bc3a582","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-function-tree]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。"},{"id":"37dcefa1c874faab","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-function-tree]]。"},{"id":"94da30522fe93e7f","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-function-tree]]；see [[20-df-e-splitting]]；see [[20-df-e-colored-node]]；see [[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。"},{"id":"05d82ffd170fb7a6","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-function-tree]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。"},{"id":"d85c7ced66d7ccee","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-function-tree]]"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-168","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-function-tree]] — 章 12；直接提供者 5 个。"},{"id":"226855fedac0ee1c","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"新增直接依赖：[[20-df-function-tree]]；[[20-df-pairing]]"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-168","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-function-tree]]"}],"outgoing":["755e421576224435","3f7915f8f8ad037c"